[b]CHANGES[/b]
- The EMF detector has increased the detection range;
- The demon's viewing angle has been slightly reduced; 
- Decreased the volume of steps when you walking and croaching;
- Changed patrol system for demons;

[b]FIXES[/b]
- If you using UV the Black fog shoudn't blind you;
- Fixed bug with rat's collision;

[b]SHOCKER[/b]
Medium creatures now die with 1 shot instead of 2;

[b]UV LAMP[/b]
Black smoke is destroyed even faster;
Flies are destroyed even faster;

[b]MEDSTATION[/b]
You can get new injector even faster

[b]MAIN DOOR[/b]
The time of blocking the door by a monster has been reduced;

[b]FLYING BLACK SMOKE[/b]
The time between repeated attacks is increased;

[b]MONSTERS[/b]
Reduced the movement speed of the main monsters;

